# Security

- Never commit or log secrets; config via environment ({{ENV_PATTERN}}). `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` documents every variable.
- Validate and sanitize input at every boundary ({{BOUNDARY_EXAMPLES}}).
- Every new endpoint/surface states its auth requirement explicitly, even if "public by design"; authorization is checked server-side, never only in UI.
- Dependencies: prefer stdlib and existing deps; new deps need a reason in the PR.

